1
00:00:08,659 --> 00:00:11,113
The suspense of the *blank* is killing me.

2
00:00:19,278 --> 00:00:21,967
Riveting. A *snowy* road and a car.

3
00:00:29,896 --> 00:00:32,141
A floating head for a welcoming committee.

4
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:39,186
The *rush* of a twenty-five mile per hour zone...

5
00:00:56,577 --> 00:00:58,598
A *very* loose parade...

6
00:01:05,950 --> 00:01:07,484
The trolley is the *main* float.

7
00:01:11,295 --> 00:01:16,263
A *thrilling* cluster of ten people on a sidewalk... really captures the scale of this parade.

8
00:01:22,453 --> 00:01:26,164
Three red lights just to make *sure* that police SUV gets through.

9
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,654
And here's the *final* parade float

10
00:01:40,017 --> 00:01:43,728
Green light... and the man in the green jacket *finally* commits.

11
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:01,559
Patiently guarding the trucks...

12
00:02:07,150 --> 00:02:09,474
Intense dashboard *action* here.

13
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:19,712
That yellow sign is *optimistic* for this weather.

14
00:02:26,699 --> 00:02:28,838
...very *thrilling* slushy intersection.

15
00:02:37,367 --> 00:02:41,860
Twenty-seven miles per hour. Truly *living* on the edge.

16
00:02:47,936 --> 00:02:52,257
Nothing says *old town vibe* like a row of late-model SUVs...

17
00:02:58,554 --> 00:03:02,967
A lot of... *cones*? That's the big reveal?

18
00:03:09,173 --> 00:03:13,434
A *murder murdering* over a pair of eights... the stakes are just too high.

19
00:03:19,841 --> 00:03:22,235
And the red truck *definitely* didn't like it.

20
00:03:30,409 --> 00:03:33,120
He's describing his driving like it's a *legal* deposition.

21
00:03:41,028 --> 00:03:43,799
A *manner* that looks like a slow crawl past a hotel...

22
00:03:51,646 --> 00:03:54,427
The 'maybe' is doing a lot of heavy lifting there.

23
00:04:02,315 --> 00:04:05,027
From *apologetic* to biohazard in six seconds.

24
00:04:12,883 --> 00:04:16,515
A 35-mph hill... right past the *filthy* lot.

25
00:04:23,502 --> 00:04:26,211
Another *exciting* landmark... the metal rail.

26
00:04:37,150 --> 00:04:40,939
Just some orange poles and *existential* dread.

